Alright, here we go.

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:26.720
First step. We're gonna go four to the right.

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:30.760
Now, we call the next part...

00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:34.860
Walk it back and then hit the floor.

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:40.080
[buzzer sounds]

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:41.820
Quiet, please!

00:00:42.320 --> 00:00:43.520
